    "build-native.sh": "Captures exact binary/source versions, repository URLs, .deb hashes, and matching source archives for direct apt_packages inputs; records installed-packages.tsv and installed-file-owners.tsv for the full image. These are inventory maps, not the incorporated-code closure.",
